{"id":"14f69cc09dc02600","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-circuit-size.md","title":"df-circuit-size (Circuit Size)","display":"df-circuit-size (Circuit Size)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"display":"df-circuit-size (Circuit Size)","label":"28-df-circuit-size","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-circuit-size","Circuit Size"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1","source_printed_pages":"107–108,117","source_pdf_pages":"133–134,143","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circuit-size (Circuit Size)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-circuit-size"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-circuit-size</span><span>Circuit Size</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108,117"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"133–134,143"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(V,E,(i_1,\\ldots,i_n),\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\">\\(C=(V,E,(i_1,\\ldots,i_n),\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{size}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wire}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{wire}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq\n\\left|V\\setminus\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_n\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq\n\\left|V\\setminus\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_n\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wire}(C)\\coloneqq|E|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wire}(C)\\coloneqq|E|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>本条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 明确采用非输入门数的本地计量约定。原书 Definition 6.1 的大小计全部顶点，故对本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 输入电路其原书对应量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\">\\(n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\)</span>；二者不能逐实例等同。该差别在硬度、伪随机性及定量转换中必须保留。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definitions 6.1–6.2 and §6.7.1，印刷页 107–108,117；PDF 页 133–134,143。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C=(V,E,(i_1,\\ldots,i_n),\\vec o,\\tau)\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wire}:\\bigcup_{n\\ge0,m\\ge1}\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,m}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq\n\\left|V\\setminus\\{i_1,\\ldots,i_n\\}\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wire}(C)\\coloneqq|E|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+\\operatorname{size}(C)","display":false}],"bytes":1466,"backlinks":[{"id":"51d96e53efebc2d6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}$、$\\operatorname{BF}$、$\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；非输入门数 $\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。"},{"id":"4c85902878b27217","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。"},{"id":"348985e8f68576a3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{size}$、$\\operatorname{depth}$ 分别见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-depth]]。"},{"id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{siz